WEBVTT

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:02.968
Ultimately, I'm here
with a message of hope.

00:12:03.969 --> 00:12:07.222
We are on the cusp of a revolution.

00:12:08.974 --> 00:12:11.977
mRNA is about to change
the world forever,

00:12:12.019 --> 00:12:14.772
and it's all thanks
to these fatty little balls

00:12:15.731 --> 00:12:19.526
that take this miracle medicine
to exactly where it's needed.

00:12:19.526 --> 00:12:20.778
Thank you.

00:12:20.819 --> 00:12:24.740
(Applause)